 137++A07B              ; Reopen the permanent ATM shadow-port/DOSEN state after an RTC access.
 138++A07B              ; DS12887_OPEN/CLOSE uses #EFF7, whose A9=1 write closes the permanent
 139++A07B              ; DOSEN path. Re-enter #3Dxx, execute OUT (C),A from the TR-DOS ROM, and
 140++A07B              ; write #C6 to #0177: A9=0 keeps shadow ports/DOSEN active and RG=6 restores
 141++A07B              ; the fixed ATM 80x25 text mode. ROM2 and WIN0 selector #3FF7=#BF must remain
 142++A07B              ; configured by p126_atm_video_init.
